   \]

3. **Determine the infusion time**:  
   \[
   \text{Infusion time} = \frac{\text{Total dose}}{\text{Infusion rate}} = \frac{334 \text{ mg}}{0.5 \text{ mg/kg/min}} = 668 \text{ min}
   \]

4. **Convert minutes to hours**:  
   \[
   668 \text{ min} \times \frac{1 \text{ hour}}{60 \text{ min}} = 11.13 \text{ hours}
   \]

