   The cone \( C \) is defined as the set of all linear combinations of \( a_1, \ldots, a_n \) with positive coefficients. In matrix notation, this can be expressed as:
   \[
   C = \begin{vmatrix}
   \begin{vmatrix} a_1 & a_2 & \ldots & a_n \end{vmatrix} \\
   \begin{vmatrix} \begin{array}
   \end{array} \\
