","a) **Retrospective**  
   - The information is to be to identify a possible link between smoking and a existing condition (bladder cancer).  
   - The data is to be inferred from prior events (smoking or not smoking).  

b) **Cross-sectional**  
   - The data is measured at a single point in time (the time of the event).  
