\[
Q^2 \approx c^2 p_i^2 - c^2 p_f^2 - (\mathbf{p}_i^2 - 2 \mathbf{p}_i \cdot \mathbf{p}_f + \mathbf{p}_f^2).
\]
Simplifying the terms:
\[
Q^2 \approx c^2 (p_i^2 - p_f^2) - (\mathbf{p}_i^2 - 2 \mathbf{p}_i \cdot \mathbf{p}_f + \mathbf{p}_f^2).
\]
Thus, the squared four-momentum transfer is:
\[
Q^2 \approx c^2 (p_i^2 - p_f^2) - (\mathbf{p}_i^2 - 2 \mathbf{p}_i \cdot \mathbf{p}_f + \mathbf{p}_f^2).
\]
This is the expression for the squared four-momentum transfer in an elastic scattering process where the electron mass is negligible.

