\[
\delta = \frac{(25 \text{ cm})^2}{4 \times 20 \text{ cm}} = \frac{625 \text{ cm}^2}{80 \text{ cm}} = 7.81 \text{ cm}
\]

Thus, the spherical aberration is \(\boxed{7.81 \text{ cm}}\).
